{
 "about": "Leads for the bosses of EldenNet's roster (O43, O59) and their bar names: the characters DataPiler found in boss slots (entity ids ending 800 to 899) of the legacy dungeons, and the character names no NpcParam row uses, grouped by the shape of their numbers. Numbers only. `barCandidates` are the unused names whose number is 90, then the slot's model, then three digits: a pattern (WHY§47), not a link the data states; the link is in the event scripts, which Smithbox cannot read (WHY§32). Every lead is unverified until EldenNet checks it in game (O48). `layer` is the earliest layer of the game's text that holds the name: 0 the base game, 1 DLC 1, 2 DLC 2. `rowName` is the real name number the slot's row carries, from roster-rows.json.",
